| `[[ package_name ]]/__init__.py` | Package version |
[% if stdlib_only %]
| `[[ package_name ]]/[[ package_name ]].py` | The whole `[[ project_name ]]` program (argparse): standard library only, runs alone as `python3 -IS` |
| `[[ package_name ]]/__main__.py` | `python -m [[ package_name ]]`, for development |
[% elif has_cli %]
| `[[ package_name ]]/config.py` | Settings and their precedence (`_FILE` > env > file > default) |
| `[[ package_name ]]/cli.py` | The `[[ project_name ]]` command (Typer) |
[% endif %]
[% if kind == 'service' %]
| `[[ package_name ]]/api.py` | The HTTP API (FastAPI): health, readiness, version |
[% endif %]
